    "number": 110,
    "title": "docs: track Pixoo controller API delivery candidate",
    "body": "Pixoo #37 is now in progress. Refresh the complete backlog and describe its native controller API candidate without claiming source acceptance. The refresh also reconciles Hub #103's verified closure after PR #104, retaining it as a completed reference.\n\nRefs https://github.com/jimmie-potts/divoom-app-upgrade/issues/37. This is the coordinator-owned guide companion for that delivery. Source candidate: https://github.com/jimmie-potts/divoom-app-upgrade/pull/58. No product spec delta applies; changes are entirely under docs/work-guide/. Public publication is outside the source-only request.\n\nValidation: guide generation and generated-output consistency pass; all five maintenance tests pass; browser checks pass at 1440, 1000, 900, 768, 390 and 320 pixels, including print expansion/restoration, links, filtering and all nine unchanged architecture viewers. The guide contains 105 primary open issues, 125 linked issues, 12 guides and 49 roadmap nodes. History and architecture keep their separate snapshot dates. HTML SHA-256: fca470dc81e332772bf96e38c0e0d8c559eb0c38cc8f22e510331db00be341ea.\n\nComparison: base/merge-base 46d430180e0791a3462b85cf70ae7d54941aae98; head e6f5004ca4d3ad8eea6d827254b091f6af8fb569. Worktree clean after rebuild. Independent Standards and Specification reviews pending. The existing guide-only CI-filter exception will be evaluated against the full changed-file list and current provider state before merge. Guide UI is exempt from human approval under the existing policy.\n\nStrategy: coordinator writes with independent read-only reviewers. No installation, device operation or public deployment.\n",
    "state": "open",
